@startuml Sequence Diagram - Quiz Flow
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam roundCorner 15
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #34495E
    LifeLineBorderColor #7F8C8D
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #2C3E50
    ParticipantFontColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantBorderColor #2C3E50
}
skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
    BorderColor #F9A825
    FontSize 11
}

title <size:22><b>Academic Event Management System</b></size>\n<size:16><color:#666666>Sequence Diagram — Quiz Creation, Attempt & Result Publishing</color></size>\n
footer <size:10>Prepared for Black Book Submission | Academic Event Management System</size>

actor "<b>Admin</b>" as Admin
actor "<b>Student</b>" as Student
participant "<b>React Frontend</b>" as FE
participant "<b>QuizController</b>\n(/api/quiz)" as QC
participant "<b>QuestionController</b>\n(/api/questions)" as QnC
participant "<b>QuizResultController</b>\n(/api/results)" as QRC
participant "<b>QuizResultService</b>" as QRS
participant "<b>NotificationService</b>" as NS
database "<b>PostgreSQL</b>" as DB

== Phase 1: Admin Creates Quiz ==

Admin -> FE : Navigate to Quiz Management\nfor Event #3
activate FE
FE -> QC : **POST** /api/quiz\n`{ "quizTitle": "React Basics",\n"event": { "id": 3 },\n"totalMarks": 100,\n"passingMarks": 40 }`
activate QC
QC -> DB : save(Quiz)\nstatus = "Draft"
activate DB
DB --> QC : Saved Quiz\n(id = 2)
deactivate DB
QC --> FE : **200 OK** — Quiz created
deactivate QC
FE --> Admin : Quiz created successfully
deactivate FE

== Phase 2: Admin Adds Questions ==

loop Add 5 questions to Quiz #2
    Admin -> FE : Add question with\n4 options + correct answer
    activate FE
    FE -> QnC : **POST** /api/questions\n`{ "quiz": { "id": 2 },\n"question": "What is JSX?",\n"optionA": "HTML syntax",\n"optionB": "CSS framework",\n"optionC": "Database",\n"optionD": "None",\n"correctAnswer": "A",\n"marks": 20 }`
    activate QnC
    QnC -> DB : save(Question)
    activate DB
    DB --> QnC : Saved
    deactivate DB
    QnC --> FE : **200 OK**
    deactivate QnC
    FE --> Admin : Question added
    deactivate FE
end

== Phase 3: Student Takes Quiz ==

Student -> FE : Click "Start Quiz"\non Event Details page
activate FE
FE -> QnC : **GET** /api/questions/quiz/2
activate QnC
QnC -> DB : findByQuizId(2)
activate DB
DB --> QnC : List<Question> (5 questions)
deactivate DB
QnC --> FE : Questions JSON\n(options shown, correct answer hidden)
deactivate QnC

FE --> Student : Display quiz interface\nwith 5 MCQ questions
deactivate FE

Student -> FE : Answer all questions\nand click "Submit"
activate FE
FE -> QRC : **POST** /api/results/submit\n`{ "userId": 5, "quizId": 2,\n"answers": ["A","B","A","C","A"] }`
activate QRC
QRC -> QRS : submitQuiz(request)
activate QRS

QRS -> DB : findByQuizId(2)\n— load Questions with correctAnswer
activate DB
DB --> QRS : List<Question>\nwith correctAnswer field
deactivate DB

QRS -> QRS : <b>Auto-Score Algorithm:</b>\nfor each question:\n  if answer == correctAnswer\n    score += marks\npercentage = (score/totalMarks)*100

QRS -> QRS : Determine status:\npercentage >= passingMarks → "PASS"\npercentage < passingMarks → "FAIL"

QRS -> DB : save(QuizResult)\nscore=80, totalMarks=100,\npercentage=80.0, status="PASS"
activate DB
DB --> QRS : Saved QuizResult\n(id = 15)
deactivate DB

QRS --> QRC : QuizResultResponse\n`{ "score": 80, "totalMarks": 100,\n"percentage": 80.0, "status": "PASS" }`
deactivate QRS
QRC --> FE : **200 OK**
deactivate QRC
FE --> Student : Display result:\n"Score: 80/100 (80%) — PASS" ✅
deactivate FE

== Phase 4: Admin Publishes Results ==

Admin -> FE : Click "Publish Results"\non Quiz Management page
activate FE
FE -> QRC : **PUT** /api/results/publish/15
activate QRC
QRC -> QRS : publishResult(15)
activate QRS

QRS -> DB : findById(15)\n+ save(published = true)
activate DB
DB --> QRS : Result published
deactivate DB

QRS -> NS : createNotification(student,\n"Quiz Result Published",\n"QUIZ_RESULT")
activate NS
NS -> DB : save(Notification)\nstatus = UNREAD
activate DB
DB --> NS : Saved
deactivate DB
deactivate NS

QRS --> QRC : 200 OK
deactivate QRS
QRC --> FE : **200 OK**
deactivate QRC
FE --> Admin : "Results published to all students"
deactivate FE

note over Student, DB
  <b>Quiz Workflow Summary:</b>
  • Phase 1: Admin creates quiz (title, marks, passing score)
  • Phase 2: Admin adds MCQ questions (A/B/C/D + correct answer)
  • Phase 3: Student attempts quiz → auto-scored instantly
  • Phase 4: Admin publishes results → students notified
  • Auto-grading: Server compares answers, calculates score & percentage
  • Pass/Fail determined by passingMarks threshold
end note

@enduml
